@startuml department-head-screen-flow
title RMS - Screen Flow: Department Head

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Screen>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<Popup>> #FFF3CD
  BackgroundColor<<Error>> #FDE2E1
  BorderColor #1E3A5F
  FontColor #172033
}

state "Sign in\n/login" as Login <<Screen>>
state "Department dashboard\n/dept-head" as Dashboard <<Screen>>
state "Create / edit recruitment request\n/dept-head/create-request\n?requestId=:id when editing" as CreateRequest <<Screen>>
state "My recruitment requests\n/dept-head/requests" as Requests <<Screen>>
state "Request details + history\nmodal" as RequestDetail <<Popup>>
state "Delete pending request\nconfirmation modal" as DeleteRequest <<Popup>>
state "Department interview calendar\n/dept-head/interviews" as Interviews <<Screen>>
state "Candidate CV preview\nmodal" as CvPreview <<Popup>>
state "Interview evaluations\n/dept-head/feedback" as Feedback <<Screen>>
state "Department settings\n/dept-head/settings" as Settings <<Screen>>
state "Add HR team member\nmodal" as AddMember <<Popup>>
state "Edit Department Head profile\nmodal" as EditProfile <<Popup>>
state "Unauthorized / workflow validation error" as Error <<Error>>

[*] --> Login
Login --> Dashboard : Login succeeds (DEPARTMENT_HEAD)\n[POST /api/v1/auth/login]
Login --> Error : Wrong role opens a Department Head route

Dashboard --> Dashboard : Load department requests and upcoming interviews\n[GET /api/v1/me/profile]\n[GET /api/v1/reports/realtime-tracking]\n[GET /api/v1/interviews/requests/:requestId/schedules]
Dashboard --> CreateRequest : Sidebar / Create Request CTA
Dashboard --> Requests : Sidebar: My Requests
Dashboard --> Interviews : Sidebar: Interviews
Dashboard --> Feedback : Sidebar: Interview Evaluations
Dashboard --> Settings : Sidebar: Dept Settings

CreateRequest --> CreateRequest : Save new draft and attach ?requestId\n[POST /api/v1/recruitment-requests]
CreateRequest --> CreateRequest : Update existing draft / revision\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]
CreateRequest --> Requests : Submit a new request\n[POST /api/v1/recruitment-requests with submit=true]
CreateRequest --> Requests : Update and submit existing request\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/submit]
CreateRequest --> Error : Required data invalid or request is not editable

Requests --> Requests : Load department-scoped workflow tracking\n[GET /api/v1/reports/realtime-tracking]
Requests --> RequestDetail : View status, details, HR suggestion and history\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]
RequestDetail --> CreateRequest : Edit Draft / Revision Required request
RequestDetail --> Requests : Accept or reject HR suggestion, then resubmit\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/submit]
RequestDetail --> DeleteRequest : Delete eligible pending request
DeleteRequest --> Requests : Confirm delete\n[DELETE /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]
DeleteRequest --> RequestDetail : Cancel
RequestDetail --> Requests : Close modal

Interviews --> Interviews : Build calendar from active requests, applications and schedules\n[GET /api/v1/reports/realtime-tracking]\n[GET /api/v1/interviews/requests/:requestId/schedules]
Interviews --> CvPreview : View candidate's latest CV\n[GET /api/v1/candidate/cvs/candidate/:candidateId/latest/file]
CvPreview --> Interviews : Close preview
Interviews --> Interviews : Accept panel attendance or mark absent\n[PATCH /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:id/interviewer-attendance]

Feedback --> Feedback : Load completed interviews and selected details\n[GET /api/v1/dept-head/interview-feedback]\n[GET /api/v1/dept-head/interview-feedback/:id]
Feedback --> Feedback : Save own scores, notes and recommendation\n[POST /api/v1/dept-head/interview-feedback/:id/my-feedback]
Feedback --> Error : Not a panel member or feedback is no longer editable

Settings --> Settings : Load profile, department team and preferences\n[GET /api/v1/me/profile]\n[GET /api/v1/users?limit=100]\n[GET /api/v1/organizations/:organizationId]
Settings --> AddMember : Add Member
AddMember --> Settings : Create an HR team member\n[POST /api/v1/dept-head/settings/team-members]
Settings --> EditProfile : Edit Profile
EditProfile --> Settings : Save display name / contact data\n[PATCH /api/v1/me/profile]
Settings --> Settings : Save notification and request preferences\n[PATCH /api/v1/organizations/:organizationId/settings]

Dashboard --> Login : Sign out\n[POST /api/v1/auth/logout]

note bottom of Dashboard
  /dashboard redirects a Department Head session to /dept-head.
end note

note bottom of Interviews
  Department Head does not start Google Calendar OAuth here.
  This screen handles panel attendance and CV preview;
  HR owns schedule creation and Google Meet integration.
end note

note bottom of Error
  ProtectedRoute redirects unauthenticated access to /login
  and wrong-role access to /unauthorized.
end note

@enduml
